        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Battery-cooling-system, passive, at plant
na;
CAS number: 7719-12-4; 
UUID: 7ba53be9-19cd-331a-b4e9-3a255a021254
All components of the cooling system: radiator, manifolds, clamps, pie fitting, thermal gap pad, coolant, as well as all the material, electricity, transport and facility required for the production of each component and the cooling system.
Location: undefined
Technology: Industry data.
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
